          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d01-s3-p4",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "Headcount reflects full-time employees at quarter end. Open roles are approved requisitions not yet filled. Attrition is annualised voluntary attrition for the department.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
