        },
        {
          "id": "d01-s8-outlook",
          "type": "text",
          "content": "For Q4 2025 the plan assumes modest sequential growth with flat headcount. The board approved a capital expenditure budget of $1.9M for Q4 2025, weighted towards edge infrastructure.",
          "style": "body",
          "position": {
            "x": 0,
            "y": 135.9
          },
          "width": 166
        },
        {
          "id": "d01-s8-p11",
